#: ../../ops/backup.rst:4
msgid "Backup and recovery"
msgstr "备份与恢复"

#: ../../ops/backup.rst:6
msgid ""
"This page describes what to save from a hub and from a node, how to "
"restore it, and what a restore changes for the other parties. Two "
"properties of ANet shape the procedures. Identity is split across places:"
" the data directory holds the keys in use, and the key that will sign "
"next is derived from a recovery seed that is kept in a separate recovery "
"file, encrypted under a passphrase. And a restored copy is detected: an "
"identity whose data has gone back to an older state is noticed by its hub"
" and by its peers."
msgstr ""
"本页说明 hub 与节点各需保存哪些内容、如何恢复,以及恢复会对其他各方产生哪些影响。ANet "
"的两个特性决定了这些步骤。其一,身份分散保存于多处:数据目录保存当前使用的密钥,而下一个用于签名的密钥由恢复种子派生,恢复种子保存在单独的恢复文件中,并以口令加密。其二,被恢复的副本可被检测:身份所对应的数据回退到较旧状态时,其所在的"
" hub 及其对等方都会察觉。"

