#: ../../ops/backup.rst:31
msgid ""
"Registry, key histories, ledger window, supply epochs, mailboxes. The "
"maintenance job writes a backup without the relay content (see below); do"
" not copy the file by hand while the hub runs, because the write-ahead "
"log (``hub.db-wal``) belongs to it."
msgstr ""
"注册表、密钥历史、账本窗口、供给纪元与邮箱。维护任务会写入不含中继内容的备份(见下文);hub "
"运行期间请勿手工复制该文件,因为预写日志(``hub.db-wal``)属于该文件的一部分。"

#: ../../ops/backup.rst:35
msgid "``hub_identity.kel``"
msgstr "``hub_identity.kel``"

#: ../../ops/backup.rst:37
msgid ""
"The hub identity file. A restore needs it: without the identity the hub "
"would start under a new AID, and the ledger, which is kept on the hub's "
"own account, would no longer be its ledger."
msgstr "hub 身份文件。恢复时需要它:没有该身份,hub 将以新的 AID 启动,而记在 hub 自身账户下的账本也将不再是它的账本。"

#: ../../ops/backup.rst:40
msgid "Hub recovery file"
msgstr "hub 恢复文件"

#: ../../ops/backup.rst:42
msgid ""
"``<home>/.anet-recovery/<last 12 characters of the AID>.anetrec``, or the"
" path given to ``--recovery-file``. Encrypted under the recovery "
"passphrase. Store it away from the host (see :ref:`ops-hub-recovery`). "
"The passphrase is not recoverable."
msgstr ""
"``<home>/.anet-recovery/<AID 的后 12 个字符>.anetrec``,或 ``--recovery-file`` "
"指定的路径。以恢复口令加密。请存放在主机之外(参见 :ref:`ops-hub-recovery`)。口令无法找回。"

