"backup like the database: restrict access to the account that runs the "
"hub."
msgstr "``hub.db`` 保存余额和 14 天的账本条目窗口。应将备份视同数据库对待:仅允许运行 hub 的账户访问。"

#: ../../ops/backup.rst:74
msgid "The maintenance job"
msgstr "维护任务"

#: ../../ops/backup.rst:76
msgid "``hub-db-roll.sh`` (installed in :ref:`ops-deployment`) runs daily. It"
msgstr "``hub-db-roll.sh``\\ (在 :ref:`ops-deployment` 中安装)每天运行,其行为如下:"

#: ../../ops/backup.rst:78
msgid ""
"checkpoints the write-ahead log on every run, so that page images of "
"deleted rows do not remain in ``hub.db-wal``;"
msgstr "每次运行均对预写日志执行检查点,使已删除行的页面映像不会残留在 ``hub.db-wal`` 中;"

#: ../../ops/backup.rst:80
msgid ""
"on Sundays writes ``hub-backup-YYYYMMDD.db`` in the data directory, keeps"
" the newest two backups, and vacuums the database when more than a fifth "
"of its pages are free;"
msgstr ""
"每周日在数据目录中写入 ``hub-backup-YYYYMMDD.db``,保留最新的两份备份,并在空闲页超过总页数的五分之一时对数据库执行 "
"vacuum;"

#: ../../ops/backup.rst:83
msgid ""
"on every run deletes backups that are 14 days old or older, by the date "
"in their names, so that ledger records are on disk at most 14 days in the"
" database and 14 days in a backup;"
msgstr "每次运行均按文件名中的日期删除已满 14 天或更久的备份,使账本记录在数据库中最多保留 14 天,在备份中最多再保留 14 天;"

#: ../../ops/backup.rst:86
msgid "appends its actions to ``roll.log`` in the data directory."
msgstr "将其操作追加记录到数据目录中的 ``roll.log``\\ 。"

#: ../../ops/backup.rst:88
msgid ""
"A backup holds everything except the tables whose rows only matter while "
"the hub runs: ``relay_message`` (the sealed envelopes), "
"``relay_redelivery``, ``dereg_event``, ``relay_dack`` and "
"``notice_cache``. The content of the mailboxes is therefore never in a "
"backup. The backup keeps the revocations of delivery credentials, the "
"quotas raised with ``anet-hub quota``, and the balance leaves of the "
"supply epochs of the last 14 days."
msgstr ""
"备份包含除下列表之外的全部内容,这些表中的行仅在 hub 运行期间有意义:``relay_message``\\ (封闭信封)、\\ "
"``relay_redelivery``\\ 、\\ ``dereg_event``\\ 、\\ ``relay_dack`` 与 "
"``notice_cache``\\ 。因此邮箱内容从不出现在备份中。备份保留送达凭证的吊销记录、通过 ``anet-hub quota`` "
"调高的配额,以及最近 14 天供给纪元的余额叶节点。"

#: ../../ops/backup.rst:95
msgid ""
"To write a backup outside the Sunday schedule, set ``FORCE_WEEKLY``. A "
"backup that already exists for the current date is kept, not rewritten:"
msgstr "如需在周日之外写入备份,请设置 ``FORCE_WEEKLY``\\ 。当前日期已有备份时,保留原备份而不重写:"

#: ../../ops/backup.rst:104
msgid ""
"Copy the backup file to separate storage; a backup beside the database "
"protects against a damaged file, not against a lost disk."
msgstr "请将备份文件复制到独立存储;与数据库放在一起的备份只能防范文件损坏,无法防范磁盘丢失。"

#: ../../ops/backup.rst:109
msgid "Restoring a hub"
msgstr "恢复 hub"

#: ../../ops/backup.rst:111
msgid ""
"Restoring a hub replaces its database with a backup. Everything that "
"happened after the backup is lost, including credit movements. Mailboxes "
"are empty after a restore."
msgstr "恢复 hub 会用备份替换其数据库。备份之后发生的一切都会丢失,包括额度的变动。恢复后邮箱为空。"

#: ../../ops/backup.rst:115
msgid "Stop the hub."
msgstr "停止 hub。"

#: ../../ops/backup.rst:116
msgid ""
"Put ``hub_identity.kel`` (and ``federation.json``, if used) in the data "
"directory if it is a new one."
msgstr "如果数据目录是新建的,将 ``hub_identity.kel``\\ (以及使用时的 ``federation.json``)放入其中。"

#: ../../ops/backup.rst:118
msgid ""
"Run the restore subcommand with the backup file, or with the directory "
"that holds it. A directory selects its newest ``hub-backup-YYYYMMDD.db``."
msgstr "以备份文件或其所在目录为参数运行恢复子命令。指定目录时,将选用其中最新的 ``hub-backup-YYYYMMDD.db``\\ 。"

