msgstr "``daemon.log``"

#: ../../ops/backup.rst:239
msgid "The node's log."
msgstr "节点日志。"

#: ../../ops/backup.rst:241
msgid ""
"A command that changes files under a running daemon (``anet retention "
"set``, the steps of ``anet identity`` that work on files, ``anet init "
"--without``) first looks at the lock. When the lock is held and the "
"control interface does not answer within a few seconds, a daemon is there"
" and busy, and the command stops with ``daemon_not_answering`` and "
"changes nothing. When the daemon answers, the command uses it; ``anet "
"init --without`` and ``--with`` stop with ``daemon_running`` instead."
msgstr ""
"在守护进程运行时修改数据目录中文件的命令（``anet retention set``、``anet identity`` "
"中处理文件的步骤、``anet init "
"--without``）会先查看该锁。锁被持有而控制接口在数秒内没有应答时，说明守护进程存在且忙碌，命令会以 "
"``daemon_not_answering`` 停止，不做任何改动。守护进程有应答时，命令通过它进行；``anet init "
"--without`` 与 ``--with`` 则以 ``daemon_running`` 停止。"

#: ../../ops/backup.rst:249
msgid ""
"A backup of this directory contains private keys and the task content "
"kept during the retention period (30 days after a task ends by default, 7"
" days for public calls). Keep it as carefully as a password store: mode "
"``0700``, on encrypted storage."
msgstr ""
"该目录的备份包含私钥和保留期内的任务内容(任务结束后默认保留 30 天,公开调用保留 7 天)。应像对待密码库一样妥善保管:权限 "
"``0700``,存放于加密存储上。"

#: ../../ops/backup.rst:254
msgid ""
"The recovery file is not in the data directory. It is ``~/.anet-"
"recovery/<last 12 characters of the AID>.anetrec``, written with mode "
"``0600``, and removing an identity with ``anet identity rm --purge`` does"
" not delete it. It is useless without the passphrase, and the passphrase "
"is not stored anywhere by ANet. Save the file and remember the passphrase"
" in separate places."
msgstr ""
"恢复文件不在数据目录中。它位于 ``~/.anet-recovery/<AID 的后 12 个字符>.anetrec``,以权限 ``0600``"
" 写入,使用 ``anet identity rm --purge`` 移除身份时也不会将其删除。没有口令时它毫无用处,而 ANet "
"不会在任何位置保存口令。请将文件与口令分开保管。"

#: ../../ops/backup.rst:262
msgid "A backup procedure"
msgstr "备份步骤"

#: ../../ops/backup.rst:264
msgid ""
"Stop the node so that the files are consistent, copy the directory, and "
"start the node again:"
msgstr "先停止节点以保证文件一致,再复制目录,最后重新启动节点:"

#: ../../ops/backup.rst:273
msgid ""
"Keep the archive on a different device from the node, and keep a copy of "
"the recovery file with a different custodian from the archive. For a node"
" run by systemd, replace ``anet stop`` and ``anet up`` with ``systemctl "
"stop`` and ``systemctl start`` of the service."
msgstr ""
"归档应保存在与节点不同的设备上,恢复文件的副本应交由与归档不同的保管人保管。由 systemd 运行的节点,请将 ``anet stop`` 与 "
"``anet up`` 换成对该服务的 ``systemctl stop`` 与 ``systemctl start``\\ 。"

#: ../../ops/backup.rst:280
msgid "Restoring a node"
msgstr "恢复节点"

#: ../../ops/backup.rst:282
msgid "Three situations differ in their consequences."
msgstr "三种情形的后果各不相同。"

#: ../../ops/backup.rst:284
msgid ""
"**Moving to another machine.** Stop the node on the old machine, copy the"
" whole data directory to the new one, and start it there. Do not start "
"the data on the old machine again. Tasks in progress continue."
msgstr "**迁移到另一台机器。** 在旧机器上停止节点,将整个数据目录复制到新机器并在那里启动。不要再在旧机器上启动这份数据。进行中的任务会继续。"

#: ../../ops/backup.rst:288
msgid ""
"**Restoring from a backup.** The state after the backup is lost. At the "
"next contact with the hub the node finds that its data is older than the "
"last key state it published, ends the tasks that were in progress, and "
"generates its encryption keys again. The tasks end with the reason "
"``local_state_lost``, and their other party is notified; new tasks are "
"not affected. The node shows the following warning for 7 days:"
msgstr ""
"**从备份恢复。** 备份之后的状态会丢失。节点在下次联系 hub "
"时发现自身数据早于其最后发布的密钥状态,会结束进行中的任务,并重新生成加密密钥。这些任务以原因 ``local_state_lost`` "
"结束,并通知其对方;新任务不受影响。节点会在 7 天内显示如下警告:"

#: ../../ops/backup.rst:299
msgid ""
"The sentence appears in ``anet status`` and as the check ``local_state`` "
"in ``anet doctor``."
msgstr "该语句出现在 ``anet status`` 中,并作为检查项 ``local_state`` 出现在 ``anet doctor`` 中。"

#: ../../ops/backup.rst:302
msgid ""
"A backup that is newer than the latest key publication, at most about a "
"day old, is not detected as a rollback. A node with no hub configured "
"does not perform the check."
msgstr "比最近一次密钥发布更新的备份(至多约一天之前)不会被判定为回滚。未配置 hub 的节点不执行此项检查。"

#: ../../ops/backup.rst:314
msgid ""
"**Only the recovery file remains.** The identity can be recovered from "
"the recovery file and its passphrase into a new data directory. The old "
"task history is not restored; the new directory has no interactions, so "
"no rollback is reported."
msgstr "**仅剩恢复文件。** 可凭恢复文件及其口令将身份恢复到新的数据目录中。旧的任务历史不会恢复;新目录中没有交互记录,因此不会报告回滚。"

#: ../../ops/backup.rst:328
msgid ""
"A recovery file that has no passphrase cannot be used this way. It "
"belongs to an identity that joined a hub without a terminal and works "
"only together with its own data directory, from which ``anet identity "
"protect`` sets a passphrase (see :ref:`topics-identity`)."
msgstr ""
"没有口令的恢复文件无法这样使用。它属于在没有终端的情况下加入 hub 的身份,只能与其自身的数据目录配合使用,并需在该目录中通过 ``anet "
"identity protect`` 设置口令(参见 :ref:`topics-identity`)。"

#: ../../ops/backup.rst:334
msgid "Never run two copies of one identity"
msgstr "切勿同时运行同一身份的两份副本"

#: ../../ops/backup.rst:336
msgid ""
"Two data directories of the same identity that run at the same time "
"compete for one mailbox at the hub. Each finds that its data is older "
"than the state the other published, ends its tasks, and one copy can read"
" and acknowledge messages the other needed. The second detection within 7"
" days is reported as a failure (``local_state.repeated``). If a rollback "
"warning appears and no backup was restored and no directory copied, the "
"data directory may have been copied by someone else. Run:"
msgstr ""
"同一身份的两个数据目录同时运行时,会争用 hub "
"上的同一个邮箱。每一份都会发现自己的数据早于对方发布的状态,从而结束各自的任务,并且其中一份可能读取并确认另一份所需要的消息。7 "
"天内第二次检测到该情形时,将作为故障上报(``local_state.repeated``)。如果出现回滚警告,但并未恢复过备份,也未复制过目录,则数据目录可能已被他人复制。请运行:"

#: ../../ops/backup.rst:348
msgid ""
"The emergency rotation invalidates the signing key of the other copy, "
"replaces every secret that can be copied from the data directory, ends "
"tasks in progress with the reason ``key_compromise``, and sets a new "
"recovery passphrase. It needs the recovery passphrase and a terminal."
msgstr ""
"紧急轮换会使另一份副本的签名密钥失效,替换所有可从数据目录复制得到的机密,以原因 ``key_compromise`` "
"结束进行中的任务,并设置新的恢复口令。它需要恢复口令和终端。"

#: ../../ops/backup.rst:355
msgid "Damaged or incompatible data directories"
msgstr "损坏或不兼容的数据目录"

#: ../../ops/backup.rst:357
msgid ""
"The node refuses to start in a data directory it cannot use and leaves "
"the directory unchanged:"
msgstr "节点拒绝在无法使用的数据目录中启动,并保持该目录不变:"

#: ../../ops/backup.rst:360
msgid ""
"``This data directory is from an earlier release (anet 0.2 or "
"AgentNetwork 1.x), and 0.3 does not migrate old data; move it away and "
"run anet up to create a new identity.``"
msgstr ""
"``This data directory is from an earlier release (anet 0.2 or "
"AgentNetwork 1.x), and 0.3 does not migrate old data; move it away and "
"run anet up to create a new identity.``"

#: ../../ops/backup.rst:361
msgid ""
"Release 0.3 does not migrate old identities. Move the directory away; "
"from 0.3.5, ``install.sh`` renames it to ``~/.anet-"
"legacy-<version>-<time>``. The new identity must join a hub again."
msgstr ""
"0.3 版不迁移旧身份。请将该目录移开；自 0.3.5 起，``install.sh`` 会将其改名为 ``~/.anet-"
"legacy-<版本>-<时间>``。新身份须重新加入 hub。"

#: ../../ops/backup.rst:365
msgid ""
"``This data directory was written by a newer anet, which this version "
"cannot open; run anet update and start again (do not delete the "
"directory).``"
msgstr ""
"``This data directory was written by a newer anet, which this version "
"cannot open; run anet update and start again (do not delete the "
"directory).``"

#: ../../ops/backup.rst:366
msgid "The data is valid. Upgrade the program."
msgstr "数据有效。请升级程序。"

#: ../../ops/backup.rst:368
msgid ""
"``The identity file ... is damaged and cannot be read, so anet did not "
"start``"
msgstr ""
"``The identity file ... is damaged and cannot be read, so anet did not "
"start``"

#: ../../ops/backup.rst:369
msgid ""
"Restore ``identity.kel`` from a backup, or recover the identity from its "
"recovery file with ``anet identity recover``."
msgstr "从备份中恢复 ``identity.kel``,或使用 ``anet identity recover`` 凭恢复文件恢复该身份。"

#: ../../ops/backup.rst:372
msgid ""
"The hub refuses a damaged or incompatible data directory in the same way "
"(see :ref:`ops-hub`)."
msgstr "hub 对损坏或不兼容的数据目录同样拒绝启动(参见 :ref:`ops-hub`)。"

#: ../../ops/backup.rst:377
msgid "Deletion and backups"
msgstr "删除与备份"

#: ../../ops/backup.rst:379
msgid ""
"ANet deletes content by schedule: task content at the end of its "
"retention period, encryption keys when they can no longer be used, and "
"hub ledger entries after 14 days. These deletions act on the files in "
"use. Copies in backups, snapshots of a copy-on-write file system, and "
"blocks left on a solid-state device are outside what the software can "
"delete. Apply the retention period to backups as well: expire the "
"archives of a node and the backups of a hub on a schedule that matches "
"what is promised to users. The maintenance job does this for hub backups,"
" which it keeps for at most 14 days."
msgstr ""
"ANet 按计划删除内容:任务内容在保留期结束时删除,加密密钥在不再能使用时删除,hub 账本条目在 14 "
"天后删除。这些删除作用于正在使用的文件。备份中的副本、写时复制文件系统的快照,以及固态设备上遗留的数据块,不在软件可删除的范围之内。保留期同样应适用于备份:按照对用户的承诺,定期使节点的归档和"
" hub 的备份过期。维护任务会对 hub 备份执行此操作,备份最多保留 14 天。"

#~ msgid "Private state of modules (for example the local A2A interface address)."
#~ msgstr "模块的私有状态(例如本地 A2A 接口地址)。"

